From 4c62ca22da08539417d31c7f96f2d88122abe68b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:36:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dicts: translate the new Backup & Restore tokens into all 24
 languages

RBKP_15-18 (panel title, chooser line, two scope badges) went in as English
placeholders; the 2026-08-24 pass left every other RBKP/RDST string fully
translated, so the new ones follow. Also carries the RBKP_2 above->below
flip into each language's translation (the EN fix landed one commit ago).
Lockstep holds at 6750 lines x 25 dicts; reaper_langcheck 0 breakers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
